5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should start by examining the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks to understand the actual impact of previous works.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into the booking data for specialist and general rooms, as well as the timetable records on rooms out of service.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I'll focus on the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to see how our personnel are coping.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll examine the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and the survey findings in the older blocks to identify any patterns in project delays.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I think it would be prudent to review the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier to gauge our financial realities.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
